I left out the `http-client` import and the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and a component that imports anything else is rejected at link time. The enrichment call would also send untrusted feed text to an external host, which this node has no grant to reach. To add it, update the graph's `with` clause first and then regenerate.

